<BaseLayout title="Privacy"><section class="container container-narrow page-shell"><h1>Privacy</h1><article class="card study-card"><p>Your answers, progress, mock history, and flashcard schedule stay in your browser. No account is required.</p><p>You can export a backup or import one from the progress page. Clearing browser storage removes local progress.</p><p>A fuller privacy document is being prepared. Until then, review the project repository on GitHub for current implementation details.</p></article></section></BaseLayout>
